CEF requires message-loop shutdown on the thread running CefRunMessageLoop.
Browser closing is asynchronous. Keep that loop alive until OnBeforeClose has
run for each browser, then release bridge-owned CEF objects before CefShutdown.
Suppress application events once termination begins; Nyxt clears its state then.
Release DevTools registrations before their browser, including normal view close.

